C51024") (unit 1))))) (text "DIGITAL SCCI ENGINEERING / ARTIFICIAL LOADS / NATIVE INDEPENDENT SUPERVISION" (at 101.6 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 4cd0de81-c8d9-507e-bfe4-a9710e87f8c2)) (text "18 guarded stimulation conductors, 17 measured RHD-side windows; conditional healthy-switch blanking is not proven isolation." (at 101.6 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 4e7dfc5d-ea79-51dc-b349-d15e2e60e531)) (text "All net labels are native electrical connections. Actual physical delay, leakage, failed switches and shared supplies remain bounded limitations." (at 101.6 416.56 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 20038734-e25d-5247-9121-8998b2b84945)) (text "Independent phase cap, heartbeat watchdog, rail windows and deliberate rearm have different functions. No automatic retry or reverse pulse." (at 101.6 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 7186692c-95a3-5f4a-953d-dbaa2cb4c6bf)))
